; Internal layer-B bindings for libxgboost via the dune ctypes plugin.
;
; The plugin reads <xgboost/c_api.h> and emits static stubs. There are two
; definitions of the [xgboost_bindings] library (public name
; xgboost.bindings), with mutually exclusive [enabled_if] fields read from
; config/provider (dune >= 3.15 allows %{read:...} there, and >= 3.16 two
; libraries with the same name as long as only one is enabled):
; - system/: link a system libxgboost >= 3.0 found by pkg-config;
; - vendored/: bundle the vendored CMake build via (foreign_archives ...).
; Both build the same ctypes descriptions from common/. Downstream code
; (layer C, tests, benches) depends on [xgboost_bindings] and gets
; whichever is enabled; the generated entry point is
; [Xgboost_bindings.C.Functions] either way.

(data_only_dirs common)
